phrases='''dark forest|cosmic thought experiment|different human responses|repetition and adaptation|science and politics|dark forest theory|scientific discovery|difficult alliance|major narrative events|cosmic danger|field of conflict|approaching trisolaran invasion|repeating historical crises|cultural revolution|immense technical ability|tension between discovery|capacity for cooperation|prospect of destruction|discovery and ideology|manipulation of matter|consequences of cosmic technologies|scientific and philosophical themes|history of expansion|mixed with deception|pressure of ideology|Remembrance of Earth’s Past|scientific possibilities|knowledge and power|periods of progress|deception and moral uncertainty|unforeseen consequences|broadcast of Earth’s position|hard-science ideas|curiosity and moral restraint|power of sophons|advanced manipulation|dimensional reduction|political convenience|trisolaran technology|upheavals in human history|three body game|red coast base|fictional hypotheses|political decisions|social institutions|subordinating truth|cosmic technologies|faith in human society|abstract questions|advanced societies|existential threat|fictional response|fictional universe|human adaptability|historical crises|limited resources|moral uncertainty|technical ability|wallfacer project|analytical route|drastic response|familiar problem|remaining unsure|scientific power|trisolaran world|human community|political power|diplomacy or warfare|scientific work|sophon blockade|unstable cycles|strategic ends|alien contact|fermi paradox|human history|simple weapon|alien threat|solar system|lethal risk|real cosmos|virtual-reality three body game|Cheng Xin’s passage|Liu Cixin’s Remembrance|Ye Wenjie’s invitation|ability to learn|divides humanity|another civilization|contact with another civilization|interfere with experiments|ethical judgment'''.split('|')
